@startuml
title Deep Research 的证据收敛循环

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #475569
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

rectangle "研究问题\n范围、时间、定义、交付标准" as q #E0F2FE
rectangle "可核查 Claims\n主张 + 所需证据类型" as claims
rectangle "搜索计划\n查询、来源优先级、覆盖缺口" as plan
rectangle "证据账本\nsource/version/span\nsupports/contradicts/uncertain" as ledger #FEF3C7
rectangle "收敛检查\n核心 claim 覆盖？冲突解释？边际收益？" as converge
rectangle "补充搜索" as search
rectangle "报告\n结论、引用、异议、限制、检索截止" as report #DCFCE7

q --> claims
claims --> plan
plan --> ledger
ledger --> converge
converge --> search : 关键缺口未闭合
search --> ledger
converge --> report : 达到停止条件

note right of converge
  搜得更多不是完成标准；
  核心主张被独立证据覆盖才是
end note
@enduml
